    "long_instructions": "The explorers called the same sites by a few different names. These names need to be standardized before the artifacts can be counted accurately.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Finish repairing the site names.\r\n- Check the artifact counts. Where did the expedition make the most discoveries?\r\n- As an optional challenge, convert Logbook 1's temperatures from Fahrenheit to Celsius as you read its data.\r\n  - To convert to Celsius, use this formula: `celsius = (fahrenheit - 32) / 1.8`\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nYou can follow the pattern established for the Temple of the Sun.\r\n",
